<p>I was expecting to enjoy this more based on the themes and the expectation of quality from Hippo, but I think I'm burned out on this idea after an endless stream of reddit posts and memes about how microtransactions are bad. It also evokes unpleasant memories of 2000s video game webcomics based on 'what if video game thing, but real?' without going anywhere with it.</p>

